Viktor 12.10.2026: «Перенеси кнопку Reset sampling на новую строку с выключкой вправо. Она вылазит за границу даже при 100% скейле страницы».

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css    | 2 ++
 tools/console/index.html | 3 +++
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index a4a2a38..345b5f4 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -4531,6 +4531,8 @@ body[data-frame] :is(#view-compose, #view-take) > .col-head > .frame-tools { mar
 .out-sub .out-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }               /* under the two samplers, column for column */
 #advDrawer .out-sub .out-grid > .field:has(> #odeSolver) { grid-column: auto; }   /* over 1168's span: two columns here */
 .reset-btn { min-width: 128px; justify-content: center; }
+.reset-row .reset-cell { padding-top: 0; }           /* HERESY 1402: Reset sampling on a row of its own, to the right */
+#cfgLyrics { min-width: 9.5em; }                       /* its «as Guidance» whole */
 #advDrawer .reset-cell { padding-top: 0; align-self: center; }
 /* HERESY 1169: the Updates card: what is here and what GitHub has, the schedule, the way an update goes */
 .upd-line { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--ink); }
diff --git a/tools/console/index.html b/tools/console/index.html
index 96f84a0..8881508 100644
--- a/tools/console/index.html
+++ b/tools/console/index.html
@@ -869,6 +869,9 @@ Blend · an add-on: two thirds Standard, one third Legacy"></select></label>
                   <span class="label">Lyrics guidance</span>
                   <input type="number" id="cfgLyrics" step="0.01" placeholder="as Guidance" value="2.2" /><span class="cfg-light" id="cfgLyricsLight" tabindex="-1" role="img"></span>
                 </label>
+              </div>
+              <!-- HERESY 1402 (Viktor 12.10.2026: «Перенеси кнопку Reset sampling на новую строку с выключкой вправо. Она вылазит за границу даже при 100% скейле»): a row of its own -->
+              <div class="field-row reset-row">
                 <div class="field grow reset-cell">
                   <button type="button" class="btn ghost small reset-btn" id="resetSampling">Reset sampling</button>
                 </div>
